{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f4b42319b5148d6e11699320d31aaad55b0b11a773fff39c4977e30aa54eb9f", "ja": "（アイドル達が挑戦したサーカスが、いよいよ\nフィナーレを迎える……トリを務めるのは、歩だ）", "zh": "（由偶像们挑战的马戏团表演终于迎向尾声……\n担任压轴的是步。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "03514bff029d44de85d7b71abdb9b2a00392e58f9afc3b1dc0f44a47dac28241", "ja": "よーし、準備はパーフェクト！\n楽しみにしててね、{$P$}！", "zh": "好～准备万全！\n你要好好期待喔，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4cea8574a8591dded97f65851680dbbe5b41c137b4039d47a8b5a55725bd4e25", "ja": "ああ、いいフィナーレにしてくれよ！", "zh": "没问题，要来个漂亮的收尾喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0c8362183ab28f93eb7f4670983fb5fee9455e5e33a0e4b50bdcfef0ccbfa146", "ja": "……えへへっ、まかせてよ！\n最高のイリュージョンを見せてあげるからさ♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿，交给我吧！\n我会让你看见最棒的幻象的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fc870a3adc429e754957f00df03b49beff7c89d691694af68b61ca980b04b592", "ja": "アメリカ帰りのアタシにかかれば、朝飯前っ！\nなんたって、エンターテイメントの本場だからね！", "zh": "交给从美国回来的我，根本小事一桩！\n再怎么说美国都是娱乐产业的大本营嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b4a3dccfe902e692fba105e8f55dcf7ef000c177e5e60b4761b4183509d41055", "ja": "ああ、期待してる。\nレッスンの時から、歩はすごく熱心だったもんな。", "zh": "嗯嗯，我很期待，\n毕竟你从训练课程开始就很积极呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7ad656587a2804f54e96eb02e415444e8a29dee051768a0a0d061abe5dc391de", "ja": "うん！　でもアタシは、ただエンジョイしてた\nだけだけどね。曲芸って、メチャクチャ楽しくてさ！", "zh": "嗯！但我其实只是在享受那种乐趣，\n因为学杂技超好玩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "24417e6396ceb0899043c24c083c0b874be7e249358effadfa43dc803ce2cde1", "ja": "練習すればするほど上達するから、なんか\nハマっちゃってさ。みんなよろこんでくれるし……。", "zh": "练习越久就做得越顺，让人有点上瘾，\n而且大家看了也都很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4f926442bbfe43e84541567afdc08dfe83d04348ba22dea4502c51fc7e67133b", "ja": "あ～あ、もっとやりたかったな～。", "zh": "啊～真想继续下去啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b98514d089c87e059d831607545ae3547c5a9ac09c394eedc94074a77e070096", "ja": "もっとって、レッスンのことか？", "zh": "继续是指继续上训练课程吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7c5c4b96eb5d3e47509022a90eb683d92c9c0b7c0b69b6f9f5b2c3a24b93c0c7", "ja": "へへ、レッスンもだけど……アタシが出て\nマジックをやったら、サーカスは終わりなんだよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿，课程也是想继续上没错啦……你想想，\n只要我出场变完魔术，马戏团表演就结束了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bd21539bf436a2ba3a24d930f8fb462e797c095776a3bfd252f9f8a6c5df0c54", "ja": "とうとう、終わっちゃうんだな～って……。\nすごく楽しかったのにな～。", "zh": "所以就会觉得终究还是要结束啊……\n马戏团表演明明超开心的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "71aef21e960e1d296392d8ba5783ec6e397e442621848053569ca48c38ecf096", "ja": "そうだな……みんなで頑張った、いいサーカスだった。\nだからこそ、余計にそう思うのかもな。", "zh": "也对……大家都很努力，交出了一场精采的马戏团表演。\n或许正因如此，才更容易浮现这种想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f4e6766d425bfc73a74e078c66540f0f9448957fee56b903e176f836be7bdf3f", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思う？\nじゃあきっと、他のメンバーもそう思ってるよね。", "zh": "{$P$}，你也这么想？\n那其他成员一定也会这么想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2e88576021d462c538b5d0c58e67ef32b4736e4c21ef0b054d3e221c8ac8166b", "ja": "そうだな……でも、誰かが終わらせないと。\nそれは、歩の仕事だと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊……但一定要有人来划下句点才行。\n我想，这就是步的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c9af0a42728b25ab1d7e64fe1d0ba4b7bae927edd6981f973b36cc6a53a02237", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそっか……そうだよな！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n这样啊……说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "85809c8a1d83ded7ff0c1d536055f8b8920444e466a7140adc47a1a534892e01", "ja": "終わらせないといけないなら、\nアタシの手で、最高のフィナーレを飾らなきゃ！", "zh": "如果一定要划下句点的话，\n就得由我亲自演出最精采的尾声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4af4f51555070b55fbad657631a2292114c5ebc671fe034f0c784091f20e1182", "ja": "うん、その意気だ。\n……そろそろ出番だけど、やれそうか？", "zh": "没错，就是这股气势。\n……差不多要上场了，没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "396536b58d63b02bb146e145f44c400a6b11420c86ce817c1f0733c0e1e1af89", "ja": "もちろん！　一生忘れられないくらいの感動を、\n最後にアタシが、作り出してみせるよ！", "zh": "当然！\n最后就让我带给大家一辈子都忘不了的感动吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0114_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "393e298f55b1532979ca956d6f2494a1b0b0eeb589a8abe18f4fd4241add564a", "ja": "{$P$}、最後まで見ててよね！", "zh": "{$P$}，你要看到最后一刻喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
